# Scene1-4-10

; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐4-10
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:9_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:就在艾玛走在审判庭前的过道时，<br>她遇到了同样在这附近徘徊的玛格。|#0104Adv10_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛你也在搜查啊。<br>感觉你真是越来越熟练了。|#0104Adv10_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我可不想熟练做这种事……|#0104Adv10_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……不管看到过几次，每次都觉得很受打击呢。|#0104Adv10_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这次最先发现尸体的人是我……<br>当时我也没能冷静下来大叫了一声。|#0104Adv10_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（第一目击者是玛格啊）|#0104Adv10_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR6,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:今天早上，我看到审判庭的门开了，就往里面看了一眼。<br>当时我真的没想太多。|#0104Adv10_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只不过当时审判庭里没有电椅，我也没看到亚里沙。|#0104Adv10_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，是吗！？|#0104Adv10_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:是的……<br>能自由进出审判庭的机会不是少之又少嘛，<br>所以我就想着吃完早餐再进去调查看看。|#0104Adv10_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:没想到等我再进去时，<br>就发现亚里沙这个惨状……|#0104Adv10_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……真不敢相信会出这种事……|#0104Adv10_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛昨晚才跟亚里沙说过话。<br>一想到她当时的模样，艾玛无力地低下了头。|#0104Adv10_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:耳边传来一阵翅膀拍动的声音，<br>艾玛一个激灵抬起了头。|#0104Adv10_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:樱羽艾玛小姐，宝生玛格小姐。<br>请问你们有看到黑部奈叶香小姐吗？|#0104Adv10_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经好几天没看到她了。|#0104Adv10_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我也是。|#0104Adv10_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛感到一阵心虚，并说了谎话。|#0104Adv10_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:几个小时前她才跟奈叶香见过面。<br>但她总不能在这个时候说，<br>奈叶香去了调查监牢的秘密。|#0104Adv10_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我去其他地方调查一下。|#0104Adv10_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Margo Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格离开了现场。<br>她看起来憔悴了不少，走路也是软弱无力的样子。|#0104Adv10_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀哎呀……真让人头疼……<br>得在审判前找到她才行……|#0104Adv10_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（典狱长是真的到处在找<br>　奈叶香……）|#0104Adv10_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，典狱长，等一下！|#0104Adv10_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格离开后，<br>典狱长也拍了拍翅膀想飞走，<br>于是艾玛匆忙开口把它喊住。|#0104Adv10_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:有什么事吗？麻烦你长话短说……<br>我可是很忙的。|#0104Adv10_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:希望你能跟我讲一下<br>亚里沙所坐的电椅是怎么回事。|#0104Adv10_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:哦，我昨天不是说过嘛。<br>电椅发生了一些故障，<br>所以我计划在今天下午做一次检修。|#0104Adv10_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我才会把电椅升了上来。|#0104Adv10_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那就是说，<br>　昨天电椅就已经放在审判庭里了）|#0104Adv10_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是不是只要按一下椅背上的按钮<br>就会通电？|#0104Adv10_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:没错，<br>但是要按一定的步骤操作它才会启动。|#0104Adv10_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:首先要按下【拘束】按钮把囚犯拘束在电椅上。<br>如果没有把人绑好在椅子上，<br>就算按了启动按钮也不会通电。|#0104Adv10_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还有就是，就算把人绑好了，<br>也需要【密码】才可以启动。|#0104Adv10_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:这步骤还挺复杂的……|#0104Adv10_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ★電気椅子証拠品情報更新
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-2
@UpdateWitchBook Id:4-2 Category:Clue Version:2
@Wait WaitMode:i1.5
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue Wait:true LogWarning:true

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:好了吗？我真的很忙……|#0104Adv10_Warden009| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等一下。还有一个问题！|#0104Adv10_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:麻烦你跟我说说处刑台的构造。|#0104Adv10_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:就跟你们所见的一样哦。<br>处刑台由底座和处刑装置组成，<br>是可以交替更换的构造。|#0104Adv10_Warden010| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:底座升降是通过我手里的控制器，<br>或者用地下的【控制面板】来操纵。|#0104Adv10_Warden011| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『操作盤』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-7
@UpdateWitchBook Id:4-7 Category:Clue Version:1
@Wait WaitMode:i1.5
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue Wait:true LogWarning:true

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女在处刑台上受刑后……<br>下降到地下的处刑台会移动到哪里？|#0104Adv10_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:……哎，这个嘛，告诉你也无妨。<br>地下有一间【冷冻室】，<br>而受刑后的所有魔女都会在那里冷冻保存起来。|#0104Adv10_Warden012| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（地下的冷冻室……）|#0104Adv10_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为魔女是不死的，<br>所以我们会用这种方式来保存。|#0104Adv10_Warden013| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『冷凍室』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:4-6
@UpdateWitchBook Id:4-6 Category:Clue Version:1
@Wait WaitMode:i1.5
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue Wait:true LogWarning:true

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……说起来，<br>玛格刚才说她之前看到处刑台<br>是下降下去了的……|#0104Adv10_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊，应该是这样没错。<br>我这里有操作历史记录。|#0104Adv10_Warden014| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:记录显示，处刑台在昨晚9点左右曾移动过几次……<br>然后是今早9点才升上来的。<br>在那之前应该一直都在地下。|#0104Adv10_Warden015| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我这边可没有做过这种安排……<br>到底是谁给升上来的呢。<br>哎呀呀，真叫人头疼。|#0104Adv10_Warden016| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（处刑台的升降记录……<br>　看来玛格刚说的<br>　都是真话）|#0104Adv10_Ema017|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

